{"1974":{"jc":[{"t":"Jal Jhilani festival on the River Thames","p":"London","w":[]}]},"2000":{"pl":["Orlando"],"w":["At 10.30am, Swamishri attended the Daycare assembly of the shibirites' children between the ages of one to ten. Swamishri asked questions regarding the names of the murtis and an interesting interaction followed. ( See Photo Story )"]},"2002":{"pl":["Sarangpur","Amdavad","Gandhinagar"],"w":["Swamishri arrived at 11.00 a.m. (See detailed report.)","In the evening from 5.00 p.m. (See detailed report)."]},"2004":{"pl":["Kampala","Jinja"],"o":"Uganda","w":["Swamishri arrived by plane from Kisumu at Entebbe Airport in Kampala at 11.00 am. In the evening a welcome assembly was held in the BAPS mandir compound.","Over 80 devotees participated in the grand procession through the streets of Jinja. Hundreds of local residents lined the route and also enjoyed the colourful spectacle. In the evening, the sadhus presented a superb kirtan aradhana, after which a 30-minute fireworks display was held."]},"2009":{"ph":[["sorg-news-2009-08-ahmedabad-0929-1","hd929-009f.jpg","","sites/swaminarayan.org/news/2009/08/ahmedabad/photo/hd929-009f.jpg"],["sorg-news-2009-08-ahmedabad-0929-1","gh929-045f.jpg","","sites/swaminarayan.org/news/2009/08/ahmedabad/photo/gh929-045f.jpg"],["sorg-news-2009-08-ahmedabad-0929-1","gh929-063f.jpg","","sites/swaminarayan.org/news/2009/08/ahmedabad/photo/gh929-063f.jpg"],["sorg-news-2009-08-ahmedabad-0929-1","sn929-089f.jpg","","sites/swaminarayan.org/news/2009/08/ahmedabad/photo/sn929-089f.jpg"],["sorg-news-2009-08-ahmedabad-0929-1","gh929-124f.jpg","","sites/swaminarayan.org/news/2009/08/ahmedabad/photo/gh929-124f.jpg"],["sorg-news-2009-08-ahmedabad-0929-1","gh929-122f.jpg","","sites/swaminarayan.org/news/2009/08/ahmedabad/photo/gh929-122f.jpg"],["sorg-news-2009-08-ahmedabad-0929-2","sn929-145f.jpg","","sites/swaminarayan.org/news/2009/08/ahmedabad/photo/sn929-145f.jpg"],["sorg-news-2009-08-ahmedabad-0929-2","sn929-186f.jpg","","sites/swamin